2, \"end\": 433, \"text\": \"The latter has been translated into Māori and is currently in press as a bilingual English/Spanish publication.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0034-9719cd5b982f:d00\", \"start\": 434, \"end\": 547, \"text\": \"Visser works as a guide on a variety of eco-tourism adventures, from swimming with whales to visiting Antarctica.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0034-9719cd5b982f:d00\", \"start\": 548, \"end\": 577, \"text\": \"She is also a public speaker.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0034-9719cd5b982f:d00\", \"start\": 578, \"end\": 613, \"text\": \"Visser is a member of the Australia\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"current_answers\": [\"orca researcher\", \"eco-tourism guide\", \"public speaker\", \"author\"], \"candidate_answers\": [{\"candidate_id\": \"R0\", \"answer\": \"orca researcher\", \"origin\": \"initial\"}, {\"candidate_id\": \"R1\", \"answer\": \"eco-tourism guide\", \"origin\": \"initial\"}, {\"candidate_id\": \"R2\", \"answer\": \"public speaker\", \"origin\": \"initial\"}, {\"candidate_id\": \"R3\", \"answer\": \"author\", \"origin\": \"initial\"}], \"requested_slot_hint\": \"other\"}"
